<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>
        <%= title %>
    </title>
    <link href="/css/output.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unicons.iconscout.com/release/v4.0.0/css/line.css">
    <style>
        .scrollbar-hide::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }

        .scrollbar-hide {
            -ms-overflow-style: none;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="bg-surface text-gray-900 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden">

    <!-- Navigation (Glass & Gradient Rule) -->
    <nav class="fixed w-full bg-surface/70 backdrop-blur-[20px] z-50 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center h-24">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div
                        class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-135 from-primary to-primary-container flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-2xl shadow-ambient">
                        <i class="uil uil-graduation-cap"></i>
                    </div>
                    <span class="font-display font-bold text-2xl tracking-tight text-gray-900">OSIS SMA DIRA</span>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-12">
                    <a href="/" class="text-primary font-bold transition-colors">Beranda</a>
                    <a href="#proker" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-primary font-semibold transition-colors">Program
                        Kerja</a>
                    <a href="/struktur"
                        class="text-gray-500 hover:text-primary font-semibold transition-colors">Struktur Organisasi</a>
                    <a href="#kontak"
                        class="text-gray-500 hover:text-primary font-semibold transition-colors">Kontak</a>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:flex">
                    <a href="/admin"
                        class="bg-gradient-135 from-primary to-primary-container text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-all shadow-ambient hover:shadow-ambient-hover hover:-translate-y-1">Portal
                        Admin</a>
                </div>
                <div class="md:hidden flex items-center">
                    <button class="text-gray-600 hover:text-primary text-3xl focus:outline-none"><i
                            class="uil uil-bars"></i></button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section (Editorial Scale) -->
    <section class="relative pt-40 pb-20 lg:pt-56 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden items-center flex min-h-[90vh]">

        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 w-full">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
                <!-- Text Content: Asymmetrical Margins -->
                <div class="text-center lg:text-left lg:ml-8">
                    <div
                        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-primary font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse"></span> Mari Berkarya Bersama
                    </div>
                    <!-- Display-Lg: Tight Tracking -0.02em -->
                    <h1
                        class="text-6xl lg:text-[5rem] font-display font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tighter leading-[1.05] mb-8">
                        OSIS SMA DIRA <br />
                        <span class="text-primary">BISA!</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                        Wadah aspirasi dan kreativitas siswa. Bersama membangun generasi berprestasi, inovatif, dan
                        berkarakter mulia dalam harmoni kolaborasi.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 justify-center lg:justify-start">
                        <a href="/agenda"
                            class="px-10 py-5 bg-gradient-135 from-primary to-primary-container text-white rounded-full font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm hover:shadow-ambient-hover transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3 group shadow-ambient">
                            Lihat Semua Agenda
                            <i class="uil uil-arrow-right text-xl group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Hero Abstract Art (No Borders, Tonal Layers) -->
                <div class="relative hidden lg:block">
                    <div class="relative w-[550px] h-[550px] mx-auto z-10">
                        <div
                            class="absolute inset-0 bg-surface-container-low rounded-[3rem] rotate-3 scale-105 transition-transform hover:rotate-6 duration-700 shadow-ambient">
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="absolute inset-0 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-[3rem] -rotate-3 overflow-hidden shadow-ambient-hover p-12 flex flex-col justify-between">
                            <div class="flex-1 mt-4 flex flex-col gap-6">
                                <div class="h-6 bg-surface-container rounded-full w-1/4"></div>
                                <div
                                    class="h-48 bg-primary rounded-[2rem] w-full flex items-center justify-center text-primary-dim text-7xl shadow-inner">
                                    <i class="uil uil-compass"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-4">
                                    <div class="h-28 bg-surface-container-low rounded-[1.5rem]"></div>
                                    <div
                                        class="h-28 bg-surface-container-low rounded-[1.5rem] bg-gradient-135 from-tertiary-fixed to-tertiary-dim">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section (Tonal Layering Principle) -->
    <section class="py-32 bg-surface-container-lowest relative">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
                <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Tentang Kami</h2>
                <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8 tracking-tight">Membangun
                    Karakter Melalui Aksi Nyata</h3>
                <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">Kami adalah motor penggerak kegiatan
                    kesiswaan. Melalui berbagai inisiatif, kami berupaya menciptakan lingkungan yang positif dan
                    inklusif di lingkungan SMA DIRA.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
                <div
                    class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-[2rem] p-10 hover:bg-surface-container-lowest hover:shadow-ambient transition-all duration-300 group">
                    <div
                        class="w-16 h-16 rounded-[1.25rem] bg-surface-container-lowest text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-sm">
                        <i class="uil uil-users-alt"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Sinergi Solid</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">Membangun kerjasama tim yang kuat antar anggota
                        dan seluruh siswa untuk visi bersama.</p>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-[2rem] p-10 hover:bg-surface-container-lowest hover:shadow-ambient transition-all duration-300 group">
                    <div
                        class="w-16 h-16 rounded-[1.25rem] bg-surface-container-lowest text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-sm">
                        <i class="uil uil-lightbulb-alt"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Inovasi Kreatif</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">Terus menciptakan program-program adaptif dan
                        modern yang relevan dengan minat siswa saat ini.</p>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-[2rem] p-10 hover:bg-surface-container-lowest hover:shadow-ambient transition-all duration-300 group">
                    <div
                        class="w-16 h-16 rounded-[1.25rem] bg-surface-container-lowest text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-sm">
                        <i class="uil uil-chart-growth"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Dampak Nyata</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">Berfokus pada hasil kegiatan yang mampu
                        memberikan manfaat terukur secara langsung.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Council Pulse Feed (Program Kerja Terbaru) -->
    <section id="proker" class="py-32 bg-surface-container relative">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <!-- Section Header -->
            <div class="mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-tertiary tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4">Council Pulse</h2>
                <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Agenda Terkini
                </h3>
            </div>

            <!-- "Staggered, asymmetrical layout" -->
            <div class="space-y-12">
                <% if(prokers && prokers.length> 0) { %>
                    <% prokers.forEach(function(proker) { %>
                        <div
                            class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-[2rem] p-10 shadow-ambient-hover transform transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
                            <!-- Metadata -->
                            <div
                                class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-tertiary-fixed text-tertiary-container text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-full">
                                <%= proker.tanggal_pelaksanaan %>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Hierarchy High Contrast: Title -->
                            <h4 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight">
                                <%= proker.judul %>
                            </h4>

                            <!-- The Body Text -->
                            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 font-medium leading-relaxed mb-10">
                                <%= proker.deskripsi %>
                            </p>

                            <!-- Detail Action -->
                            <a href="#"
                                class="inline-flex items-center text-primary font-bold text-sm tracking-wide uppercase group">
                                Baca Selengkapnya
                                <span class="w-8 h-px bg-primary ml-4 transition-all group-hover:w-16"></span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <% }); %>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <div class="py-24 text-center bg-surface-container-low rounded-[2rem]">
                                    <h4 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-gray-500 mb-2">Belum Ada Agenda</h4>
                                    <p class="text-gray-400 font-medium">Council Pulse saat ini masih kosong.</p>
                                </div>
                                <% } %>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-16 text-center">
                <a href="/agenda"
                    class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-10 py-5 bg-surface-container-highest text-gray-900 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm rounded-full transition-all hover:shadow-ambient hover:-translate-y-1">
                    Buka Semua Agenda <i class="uil uil-arrow-right text-lg"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer id="kontak" class="bg-surface-container-lowest pt-32 pb-16 border-t border-surface-variant/20">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-16 mb-24">
                <div class="md:col-span-5">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
                        <div
                            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-2xl">
                            <i class="uil uil-graduation-cap"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="font-display font-bold text-2xl tracking-tight text-gray-900">OSIS SMA DIRA</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10 pr-8">
                        Wadah kreativitas, inovasi, dan prestasi siswa. Membangun generasi pemimpin masa depan.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-3">
                    <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-8">Tautan Penduduk</h4>
                    <ul class="space-y-5">
                        <li><a href="#" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-primary font-medium transition-colors">Tentang
                                Kami</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/agenda"
                                class="text-gray-600 hover:text-primary font-medium transition-colors">Agenda Pulse</a>
                        </li>
                        <li><a href="/struktur"
                                class="text-gray-600 hover:text-primary font-medium transition-colors">Vanguard Team</a>
                        </li>
                        <li><a href="/admin"
                                class="text-gray-600 hover:text-primary font-medium transition-colors">Panel Admin</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-4">
                    <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-8">Hubungi Kami</h4>
                    <ul class="space-y-6">
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                            <i class="uil uil-map-marker mt-1 text-xl text-gray-400"></i>
                            <span class="text-gray-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">Gedung Pusat Kegiatan
                                Siswa,<br />SMA DIRA</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <i class="uil uil-envelope text-xl text-gray-400"></i>
                            <span class="text-gray-600 font-medium">mail@osis.smadira.sch.id</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6 text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium">
                <p>&copy; 2026 OSIS SMA DIRA. Didesain dengan gagasan The Academic Vanguard.</p>
                <div class="flex gap-6">
                    <a href="#" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors text-xl"><i
                            class="uil uil-instagram"></i></a>
                    <a href="#" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors text-xl"><i class="uil uil-youtube"></i></a>
                    <a href="#" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors text-xl"><i class="uil uil-twitter"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>

</html>